# Session handoff files (Claude Code) — local working notes, never committed.
# Briefly tracked on main (#255/#256) so a fresh session could find it without
# knowing the active branch; reverted because landing every update through a
# docs-only PR cost more than the file is worth.
SESSION_HANDOFF.md
**/SESSION_HANDOFF_AUTO_*.md

